    "body": "Part of what complicates the issue is that the text of the form section points out the primary reason that form controls are allowed to appear outside of a `<form>` tag it to workaround the restriction that `<form>` tags cannot be nested, which could be inferred to imply that is the only reason to not nest them inside a `<form>`.",
