    "body": "This is a lot of text, but I think the following might get at the core of your issue:\r\n\r\nThe spec does not have an opinion outside of validity on this subject. We always welcome more examples; if you can't find any examples of controls used outside of forms, then a pull request adding those would be great. (But, not in the forms section! In the individual controls sections'!)",
